==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 4~16 seconds<sup>120f~480f</sup>.
*100 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
*3 [[Chief Peng]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
**200 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
**3 [[Chief Peng]]s spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
**2 [[Chief Peng]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.33 seconds<sup>2f~10f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Only attempt this stage if your [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] are at least level 10. If so, do the same thing that you would do in Ch.1 [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]]. The difference is that the Chief Pengs are a way stronger support enemy than the ones encountered there. Note that [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] can knock The Face back in a single hit, so use him if you have him.

